                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A motorized garden tool that propels air out of a nozzle to move leaves and other debris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "629c9612-9f56-48d9-8364-a63aa94dd2d8",
                                                "sense_id": "59f08334-7462-3e6c-bb89-d5b0797b9602",
                                                "text": "[…] the leaf blower? Like the Davy Crockett, it is something that should have never been invented. To subjectively paraphrase Shakespeare, a noisy, consumer-grade leaf blower is a device used “by an idiot, full of sound and fury, and that does almost nothing.”"
